title start
kind: note
tags: business-plan conventions hardware-spec-page-template
Conventions hardware spec page template
title end

paragraph start
A hardware spec page covers one piece of equipment or one equipment category. It states the job the equipment must do before it names any product.
paragraph end

paragraph start
It is a note page with the fields as plain lines in one code block.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
job to do      what it must achieve
minimum        the weakest acceptable level
preferred      the better option if the budget allows
budget limit   the most to spend
where to buy   shops or sellers
status         needed, ordered, owned or retired
replacement    what happens when it fails
code end

